  "核对实值、无散、零均值、Leray 自伴性和三波守恒。": "Verify real-valued, divergence-free, zero-mean, Leray self-adjointness, and triad conservation.",
  "计算笔记，不是新定理": "Calculations notes, not new theorems",
  "记 \\(\\Lambda=(-\\Delta)^{1/2}\\)，其非零 Fourier 模乘子为 \\(|k|\\)； 零均值保证齐次 Sobolev 范数在本域上没有零频歧义。": "Let \\(\\Lambda=(-\\Delta)^{1/2}\\), whose non-zero Fourier modes are multiplied by \\(|k|\\); zero mean ensures no zero frequency ambiguity in homogeneous Sobolev norms on this domain.",
  "检查 1": "Check 1",
  "检验“非局部三波成对近抵消”能否在临界频率包络中产生可求和缺陷因子。": "Test whether \"non-local triad pair near cancellation\" can produce summable defect factors within the critical frequency envelope.",
  "将方程与 \\(u\\) 作 \\(L^2\\) 内积。周期边界、无散条件与积分分部给出": "Take the inner product of the equation with \\(u\\) in \\(L^2\\). Periodic boundary conditions, the divergence-free condition, and integration by parts give",
  "将上述三波复制到尺度 \\(N_j=8^j\\)（\\(j=0,1,2\\)），并加入相反波数。 计算机穷举核对：这些尺度副本之间不存在“两个已支持模相加后落回另一个已支持模”的跨壳共振， 因而在初始时刻，各壳的三波传递可独立叠加。若第 \\(j\\) 壳振幅乘 \\(A_j\\)，则其 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 非线性贡献按": "Replicate the triad above at the scales \\(N_j=8^j\\) (\\(j=0,1,2\\)) and include the opposite wavenumbers. An exhaustive computer check shows that no cross-shell resonance occurs in which two supported modes add to another supported mode among these scale copies. Thus, at the initial time, the triad transfers in different shells can be superposed independently. If the amplitude in shell \\(j\\) is multiplied by \\(A_j\\), then its nonlinear contribution to \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) scales as",
  "将所有振幅复共轭会把三个 \\(T\\) 同时反号，所以这个临界传递既可为正也可为负。 因而 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 没有类似 \\(L^2\\) 的非线性单调性。": "Complex-conjugating all amplitudes reverses the signs of all three \\(T\\) values, so this critical transfer can be positive or negative. Thus \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) has no nonlinear monotonicity analogous to that of \\(L^2\\).",
