  "取旋度得到": "taking the curl yields",
  "如果一个估计声称只由基本能量控制临界范数，就要说明它如何跨越 \\(\\|u_\\lambda\\|_2=\\lambda^{-1/2}\\|u\\|_2\\) 与临界指数 \\(0\\) 之间的半阶缺口。 如果推导没有产生额外结构或尺度小因子，缩放表明它不能闭合。": "if an estimate claims to be controlled by basic energy for critical norms, explain how it spans the half-order gap between \\(\\|u_\\lambda\\|_2=\\lambda^{-1/2}\\|u\\|_2\\) and the critical exponent \\(0\\). If the derivation does not produce additional structure or scale factors, scaling indicates it cannot close.",
  "若 \\(Y=\\|\\omega\\|_2^2\\)，得到 \\(Y'\\lesssim\\nu^{-3}Y^3\\)。 这个常微分不等式允许有限时发散，因此不是全局先验估计。": "if \\(Y=\\|\\omega\\|_2^2\\), obtain \\(Y'\\lesssim\\nu^{-3}Y^3\\). This ordinary differential inequality allows finite-time blow-up, hence is not a global a priori estimate.",
  "若要寻找新的临界耗散机制，它不能是逐三波的定号性。 可以继续检查许多三波之间的成对抵消、相位不相容、角度退化、 局部/非局部相互作用的净效应，或这些结构与黏性时间尺度的联合约束。": "to seek new critical dissipative mechanisms, it cannot be sign-definitive on three-waves. Continue checking many pairs of three-wave cancellations, phase incompatibilities, angle degradations, net effects of local/nonlocal interactions, or these structures with the viscous time scale constraints.",
