  "三个无散条件逐项成立；再规定 \\(u_{-a}=\\overline{u_a}\\)，便得到实值、零均值的三角多项式初值。 把振幅代入上一节公式：": "The three divergence-free conditions hold term by term. Defining \\(u_{-a}=\\overline{u_a}\\) then gives real-valued, zero-mean trigonometric-polynomial initial data. Substituting the amplitudes into the formula from the previous section gives:",
