  "为消除 \\(2\\pi\\) 因子，下面的计算采用 \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}=(\\mathbb R/2\\pi\\mathbb Z)^3\\)。 这与 Clay 命题 B 使用的单位周期环面通过线性尺度变换等价；以后引用 Clay 命题时仍明确写出这一归一化差异。": "to eliminate the \\(2\\pi\\) factor, the following calculations use \\(\\mathbb T^3_{2\\pi}=(\\mathbb R/2\\pi\\mathbb Z)^3\\). This is equivalent to the unit period torus used in Clay Problem B via linear scaling; when referring to Clay Problems hereafter, this normalization difference will be explicitly noted.",
