  "我会用以下几项检查每个候选估计：精确假设、尺度指数、最坏三波、 分离多壳测试，以及它与 Tao averaged 非线性的区别。": "I will check each candidate estimate with the following items: precise assumptions, scale exponents, worst three-wave interactions, separation multi-shell tests, and its distinction from Tao's averaged nonlinearity.",
