  "研究类固定为光滑、实值、无散、零均值速度场，因此": "The research class is fixed to be smooth, real-valued, divergence-free, zero mean velocity fields, therefore",
  "也是相同黏性系数下的解。周期域本身不在此变换下保持不变，所以这里的缩放只用来检查高频局部结构； 不能把它误写成固定环面上的连续对称群。": "are also solutions under the same viscosity. The periodic domain itself does not remain invariant under this transformation; hence, here the scaling is only used to check high-frequency local structures; it should not be mistakenly written as a fixed torus continuous symmetry group.",
