  "这份笔记用到的文献": "the literature used in this note",
  "这份笔记整理了 Leray 投影、缩放、三个能量层级和一个可以复算的三波例子。 这里没有新定理；我只是先把后续估计会用到的基础计算写清楚。": "Leray projection, scaling, three energy levels, and one recalculable triad example are organized in this note. There are no new theorems here; I merely lay out the basic calculations that will be needed for subsequent estimates.",
