  "这是全局控制，但它处在缩放临界线以下半阶，不能排除高频集中。": "This is a global control, but it is below half a scaling level and cannot exclude high-frequency concentration.",
  "这只是对候选不等式的瞬时检查，不是封闭的 Galerkin 系统，也不是持续级联解。 非线性会立即生成原支持集之外的新模；我还没有分析黏性和后续相位演化。": "Just a momentary check of the candidate inequality, not a closed Galerkin system or continuous cascading solution. Nonlinearity will immediately generate new modes outside the original support; I have not analyzed viscosity and subsequent phase evolution yet.",
