  "单三元组的三个模态能量变化率共享一个实标量 \\(\\Phi\\)。在上述规范下，它们的比值是": "the three modal energy change rates of a single triad share one real scalar \\(\\Phi\\). Under the above norm, their ratios are",
  "当三个符号相同，\\(W_s\\) 中六个二次项两两抵消，所以 \\(W_s=0\\)。 这不是 \\(g\\) 消失；它来自单三元组同时守恒能量和 helicity。 对正螺旋模态，helicity 的二次权重正好是 \\(K\\)，与 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 平方的权重相同。": "when the three signs are the same, six quadratic terms in \\(W_s\\) cancel pairwise, so \\(W_s=0\\). This is not due to the disappearance of \\(g\\); it comes from the single triad simultaneously conserving energy and helicity. For positive helical modes, the quadratic weight for helicity exactly matches \\(K\\) with the weight of \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) squared.",
