  "类对应的导数 \\(\\frac1b+\\frac1{b+2}+\\frac2{b-a}-\\frac2{b+c}\\) 也为正。 这是因为 \\(c\\ge b\\) 给出 \\(1/b-2/(b+c)\\ge0\\)，剩余两项为正。 因此两类都在 \\(b=c\\)，即 \\(x=1\\) 处取到固定 \\(a\\) 的最大值。 两个问题随后归结为同一个一元函数：": "the derivative corresponding to the class \\(\\frac1b+\\frac1{b+2}+\\frac2{b-a}-\\frac2{b+c}\\) Also positive. This is because. \\(c\\ge b\\) provide \\(1/b-2/(b+c)\\ge0\\), The remaining two terms are positive. Therefore, both cases are satisfied. \\(b=c\\), that is \\(x=1\\) take it to be fixed \\(a\\) the maximum value. The two problems are then reduced to the same univariate function:",
