  "如果比值保持常数量级，再尝试解析构造；如果衰减，则定位来自符号、相位还是格点几何。": "if the ratio remains at a constant order, try analytical construction; if it decays, locate the source from symbol, phase, or grid geometry.",
  "如果数值优化只在违反现实条件、散度零条件或 Fourier 闭合时产生增益，该构造作废。 如果增益依赖浮点误差，则改用区间界或有理算术复核。": "if numerical optimization only gains when violating realistic conditions, divergence-free condition, or Fourier closure, this construction is invalid. If the gain depends on floating-point error, use interval bounds or rational arithmetic for verification.",
  "若 \\(F(t)=(2x+2-t)(2-t)(2x-t)t^3\\)，则 \\[ \\frac{F'(t)}{F(t)} =\\frac3t-\\frac1{2x+2-t}-\\frac1{2-t}-\\frac1{2x-t}>0. \\] 这里用到 \\(0\\lt t\\le x\\le1\\)：后三个分母都不小于 \\(t\\)，且不可能同时等于 \\(t\\)。": "If \\(F(t)=(2x+2-t)(2-t)(2x-t)t^3\\), then \\[ \\frac{F'(t)}{F(t)} =\\frac3t-\\frac1{2x+2-t}-\\frac1{2-t}-\\frac1{2x-t}>0. \\] Here \\(0\\lt t\\le x\\le1\\): each of the last three denominators is at least \\(t\\), and they cannot all equal \\(t\\) at the same time.",
  "三个异号类在紧的近对角区域保留 \\(O(1)\\) 临界核。": "The three opposite-sign classes retain an \\(O(1)\\) critical kernel in the compact near-diagonal region.",
  "上一篇 R0.2": "prior R0.2",
  "尚未检查": "has not been checked",
  "设非退化 Fourier 三元组满足 \\(k+p+q=0\\)，记三边长为 \\(K=|k|\\)、\\(P=|p|\\)、\\(Q=|q|\\)，螺旋符号为 \\(s_K,s_P,s_Q\\in\\{\\pm1\\}\\)。 采用 \\(\\|h_s\\|=\\sqrt2\\) 的 Waleffe 规范，三波方程中的几何系数为": "Assume a non-degenerate Fourier triad satisfies \\(k+p+q=0\\), denote the three side lengths as \\(K=|k|\\), \\(P=|p|\\), \\(Q=|q|\\), and the helical symbol as \\(s_K,s_P,s_Q\\in\\{\\pm1\\}\\). Using the Waleffe norm \\(\\|h_s\\|=\\sqrt2\\), the geometric coefficients in the three-wave equation are",
  "双精度舍入量级": "double-precision rounding order of magnitude",
  "四类都可以写成显式公式": "four classes can all be written as explicit formulas",
  "四类精确极值": "four exact extrema",
  "它在 \\(0\\le t\\le x\\) 上严格递增，所以固定 \\(x\\) 时最大值在 \\(t=x\\)，即 \\(y=1\\) 取得。 此时": "It is strictly increasing on \\(0\\le t\\le x\\), so for fixed \\(x\\) the maximum occurs at \\(t=x\\), or equivalently \\(y=1\\). In that case,",
  "特别是，孤立三元组是稀疏的。它没有产生 Bernstein 不等式中一个频率壳所含格点数带来的重数。 因此，这个极值不能直接当作完整偏微分方程估计的尖锐性反例。": "particularly, isolated triples are sparse. It does not generate the multiplicity of lattice points in a frequency shell as in Bernstein's inequality. Therefore, this extremum cannot be directly used as a sharp counterexample to full partial differential equation estimates.",
  "停止条件": "stopping condition",
  "通分后的分子为 \\(2b^2+4b+4bac+6ac>0\\)。": "fractional numerator is \\(2b^2+4b+4bac+6ac>0\\).",
  "通过": "through",
  "同号类为什么恒为零": "The same-sign class is always zero",
  "同号类有精确抵消，但三个异号类在近对角紧域上保留非零常数量级的最大值。 因此，不存在一个仅由单三元组几何产生、同时适用于全部螺旋符号类的统一小因子。": "There is exact cancellation in the same-sign class, but three opposite-sign classes retain nonzero constant magnitudes on near-diagonal compact domains. Therefore, there does not exist a unifying small factor generated solely by single triad geometries that applies to all helical sign classes.",
  "同号螺旋类的临界核恒为零；三个异号类保留非零的近对角极值。": "The critical kernel of the same-sign helical class vanishes identically; the three opposite-sign classes retain nonzero near-diagonal extrema.",
  "完整三线性型一定达到常规 \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 估计的上界；": "Complete trilinear forms necessarily achieve the upper bound of the standard \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) estimate;",
  "网格扫描": "grid scan",
  "唯一的内部最大点 \\(r_*\\in(1,2)\\) 满足 \\(3r_*^3-2r_*^2-8r_*+4=0\\)，数值为 \\(r_*\\approx1.7537162153241575\\)。于是": "The unique internal maximum point \\(r_*\\in(1,2)\\) satisfies \\(3r_*^3-2r_*^2-8r_*+4=0\\), with a numerical value of \\(r_*\\approx1.7537162153241575\\). Thus",
  "为覆盖 R0.2 的近对角区域，令 \\(x=K/P\\)、\\(y=Q/P\\)，并按边长排序后考察紧域": "To cover the near-diagonal region within R0.2, let \\(x=K/P\\) and \\(y=Q/P\\), then sort by edge length and examine the compact domain",
  "我继续检查 R0.2 留下的近对角区域。单个三元组中，同号螺旋的临界加权传递恒为零； 三个异号类仍有非零极值。计算给出了完整零点集和解析最大值。": "I continue to check the near-diagonal region left in R0.2. In single triads, the critical weighted transfer of the same-sign helical class is always zero; three opposite-sign classes still retain nonzero extremal values. Calculations provided complete zero sets and analytic maximum values.",
  "系数规范以 Waleffe 的原始工作为准，并与 Linkmann 等人写出的单三元组方程和侧长公式交叉核对。 不同文献若把螺旋基归一化为单位长度，常数会改变，但本笔记的零点和相对几何结论不变。": "The coefficient normalization is based on Waleffe's original work and cross-verified with formulas for single triad equations and side length formulas written by Linkmann et al. If different literature normalizes the helical basis to unit length, constants will change, but the zero points and relative geometric conclusions in this note remain unchanged.",
  "下一步应把单三元组扩展为一个有限但稠密的 Fourier 频率包。 目标不是立即证明先验界，而是先回答常规临界三线性估计是否能被具有散度零约束的显式数据近似饱和。": "The next step should be to extend a single triad into a finite but dense Fourier frequency packet. The goal is not immediate proof of a priori bounds but rather to first address whether the standard critical trilinear estimate can be saturated by explicit data approximations with divergence zero constraints.",
  "先固定系数规范": "Fixing the coefficient normalization",
