  "阈值上方的 Galerkin 解先有极短增长，随后传递换号并把临界能量送出初始支撑。": "Galerkin solutions above the threshold first show a brief growth, then exchange signs and send critical energy out of initial support.",
  "在 \\(N=120\\) 时，实际热流保持远长于保守下界：": "At \\(N=120\\), the actual heat flux remains far longer than the conservative lower bound:",
  "在满足 \\(\\mathfrak T(a)<0\\) 的剖面中，研究 \\(\\mathcal L(a)/|\\mathfrak T(a)|\\) 的下界或近极小序列。": "In cross-sections satisfying \\(\\mathfrak T(a)<0\\), study the lower bound or near-minimal sequence of \\(\\mathcal L(a)/|\\mathfrak T(a)|\\).",
  "增长只维持了很短时间": "Growth was sustained for only a short time",
  "这个问题比继续观察单条数值轨道更具体：它直接问能产生临界注入的剖面，是否必然同时产生同阶的法向泄漏。": "This problem is more specific than continuing to observe individual numerical trajectories: it directly asks whether any cross-section that can generate critical injection must necessarily produce a comparable normal leakage.",
