  "\\(\\Psi\\) 是注入/逃逸比，\\(\\Xi\\) 是逃逸/注入比，\\(\\Theta\\) 是切向非线性与注入方向的对齐效率；三者在振幅缩放下不变。": "\\(\\Psi\\) is the injection/escape ratio, \\(\\Xi\\) is the escape/injection ratio, and \\(\\Theta\\) is the alignment efficiency of tangential nonlinearity with the injection direction; all three are invariant under amplitude rescaling.",
