  "\\(N^{-3}\\|B_{\\rm out}\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\) 在后三个尺度稳定于约 \\(2.9\\times10^{-6}\\)。 所以 R0.5 的快速失相不是一个随 \\(N\\) 自动消失的有限格点效应。": "\\(N^{-3}\\|B_{\\rm out}\\|_{\\dot H^{1/2}}\\) is stable on the last three scales at approximately \\(2.9\\times10^{-6}\\). So R0.5's rapid phase separation is not a finite-grid effect that automatically vanishes with \\(N\\).",
