  "尝试证明固定 \\(E\\) 与 \\(|\\mathfrak T|\\) 时，\\(L_{\\rm out}\\) 的全六模态正下界；先做符号消元，再考虑半代数/SOS 证书。": "attempt to prove fixed \\(E\\) commutes with the operator \\(|\\mathfrak T|\\) when,\\(L_{\\rm out}\\) for the full lower bound of all six modalities; first perform symbol elimination, then consider half-algebraic/SOS certificate.",
