  "把所有到达 \\(a_{n+1}\\) 的五阶二叉相互作用树，按三类六叶计数和中间频率轨道分组。": "The fifth-order binary interaction tree reaching \\(a_{n+1}\\) is grouped by three categories and six leaves, categorized according to intermediate frequency orbits.",
