  "笔记状态 · 有限阶递推可复核，PDE 余项未估计": "The status of the notes · finite-order recursion is verifiable, PDE remainder unestimated",
  "不能把 10.25 当作无条件改进。": "Cannot treat 10.25 as an unconditional improvement.",
  "不能把 R0.11 的三个中心门当作完整双壳方程的主导低阶闭合。": "Cannot consider the three central gates in R0.11 as a complete double-shell equation's dominant low-order closure.",
  "不能把较大的完整目标系数直接解释为有效级联；同阶外部能量约为目标的 \\(49.34\\) 倍。": "Cannot interpret larger complete target coefficients directly as effective cascades; external energy at the same order is approximately \\(49.34\\) times the target.",
  "不能只靠缩小催化幅度提高相对纯度；目标与替代第五阶路径都含两个催化叶。": "Cannot improve relative purity by merely reducing catalytic amplitude; both targets and alternative fifth-order paths contain two catalytic leaves.",
  "不删频率的普通幂级数递推": "General power series recursion without deleting frequencies",
  "不要求单位长度": "No requirement for unit length",
