  ", JAMS 29 (2016), 601–674。级联电路在 averaged 模型中的严格实现，以及原始非线性结构所造成的区别。": ", JAMS 29 (2016), 601–674. The strict implementation of cascaded circuits in the averaged model, and the distinctions caused by the original nonlinear structure.",
  ", JFA 255 (2008), 2233–2247。临界 Besov 空间中有限 Picard/Fourier 相互作用导致范数膨胀；不蕴含本文固定族的结论。": ", JFA 255 (2008), 2233–2247. Finite Picard/Fourier interaction leading to norm inflation in critical Besov spaces; does not imply conclusions for the fixed family in this article.",
