  "对每个正输入频率，仍使用 R0.15 的无散单位极化曲线": "For each positive input frequency, still use R0.15 divergence-free unit polarization curve",
  "对上述有限极化重新计算全部第五阶带符号树。聚合后有 332 个非零频率，所有负 Laurent 次幂精确抵消。 目标能量和外部能量都是正有理数；程序保存完整分数的 SHA-256 摘要，并用整数交叉相乘证明比较符号。": "Recompute the entire fifth-order signed tree for the above finite polarization. Aggregated there are 332 non-zero frequencies, all negative Laurent powers cancel out exactly. Target energy and external energy are both positive rational numbers; the program saves complete fraction SHA-256 hash and proves comparison sign by integer cross-multiplication.",
  "二阶 Laurent 极点全部抵消；二维反对称降维失效；显式有理候选把目标能量比例提高到 5.2532%。": "Second-order poles cancel out exactly; two-dimensional antisymmetric reduction fails; explicit rational candidates increase target energy ratio to 5.2532%.",
  "二阶变分脚本：": "Second-order variation script:",
  "二阶导数直接穿过完整第五阶树": "second-order derivatives directly penetrate the complete fifth-order tree",
