  "Leray 投影后的欧氏分量和纵向分量也满足不含负 \\(\\delta\\) 幂的模式级估计。 热乘子同时满足精确恒等式 \\(\\delta^2|K_\\delta|^2=3c^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\)。 因而先前最直接的 \\(4^n\\) 壳层障碍并未出现。": "the Euclidean components and longitudinal components after Leray projection also satisfy mode-level estimates without negative \\(\\delta\\) powers. The heat multiplier simultaneously satisfies the exact identity \\(\\delta^2|K_\\delta|^2=3c^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\). Thus, the previous most direct \\(4^n\\) shell obstruction did not occur.",
