  "二者电荷均为 \\(1/6\\)，输出电荷为 \\(1/3\\)，并且解析半径没有任何余量：": "both charges of the modes are \\(1/6\\), output charge is \\(1/3\\), and there is no margin for the radius of analyticity:",
