  "令 \\(\\delta_N=4^{-N}\\)，则": "let \\(\\delta_N=4^{-N}\\),",
  "普通无量纲热率没有提供二次增益": "ordinary non-dimensional thermal rate does not provide quadratic gain",
  "取 \\(N\\asymp\\eta^{-1}\\) 后，一阶解析半径估计不可能成立；任何统一上界至少需要 \\(\\eta^{-2}\\) 阶。": "after taking \\(N\\asymp\\eta^{-1}\\), first-order estimate of the radius of analyticity cannot hold; any unified upper bound at least needs \\(\\eta^{-2}\\) order.",
  "取 \\(w_j=((1,1,1)\\times\\beta_j)/|(1,1,1)\\times\\beta_j|\\)。两个输入范数都精确为 1，而混合行列式为": "take \\(w_j=((1,1,1)\\times\\beta_j)/|(1,1,1)\\times\\beta_j|\\). Both input norms are exactly 1, while the mixed determinant is",
  "热率为 \\(3q^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\)。沿上述 \\(\\delta_N\\)，两个输入热率趋于 \\(1/12\\)，输出趋于 \\(1/3\\)，横向热率趋于零。因此它们不会随 \\(N^2\\) 增长，不能一致补偿尖锐损失。": "heat rate for \\(3q^2+\\delta^2|\\beta|^2\\). Along the above \\(\\delta_N\\), both input heat rates tend to \\(1/12\\), output tends to \\(1/3\\), and lateral heat rates tend to zero. Therefore they do not grow with \\(N^2\\) and cannot consistently compensate for sharp losses.",
  "三维 Navier–Stokes 全局正则性问题 · R0.22": "The 3D Navier–Stokes Global Regularity Problem · R0.22",
  "上界": "upper bound",
  "生成系数子空间": "generating coefficient subspace",
  "使用 R0.21 的坐标 \\(m\\in\\mathbb Z^3\\)，三个分量具有相同奇偶性，并定义": "using coordinates \\(m\\in\\mathbb Z^3\\) with R0.21, three components have the same parity and are defined by",
  "是尖锐的": "is sharp",
  "同一计算也发现，实际生成对的归一化增益只有专门尖锐极化的约 \\(0.43\\%\\)。下一步是 \\(N=3\\) 的 8 阶、7 阶输入与 16 阶输出，用来判断这种抑制是否随标签保持。": "The same computation also found that the normalized gain of actual generated pairs is only approximately \\(0.43\\%\\) for specially sharp polarizations. The next step is to consider 8th and 7th order inputs with 16th order output for \\(N=3\\), in order to determine whether this suppression persists with labels.",
  "我完成了 R0.21 留下的全空间解析权卷积估计。结果不是预期的一阶损失，而是严格二阶；一个精确模式族达到这一阶数，普通热估计也不能在壳层上一致补偿。": "I completed the full-space analytic convolution estimate left over from R0.21. The result is not a first-order loss as expected, but strictly second order; a precise mode family achieves this order, and general heat estimates cannot consistently compensate on shells.",
  "下一步只检查真实生成子空间": "next step only checks true generated subspace",
  "严格极限": "strict limit",
  "沿用纵向半范数 \\(L_\\delta(v)=\\delta^{-1}|(1,1,1)\\cdot v|\\)，并令 \\(\\mathcal N_\\delta(v)=|v|+L_\\delta(v)\\)。": "continue with the longitudinal semi-norm \\(L_\\delta(v)=\\delta^{-1}|(1,1,1)\\cdot v|\\) and let \\(\\mathcal N_\\delta(v)=|v|+L_\\delta(v)\\).",
