  "版本 v0.23 · 2026-08-18": "version v0.23 · 2026-08-18",
  "不过，实际系数携带很大的纵向 jet，而 R0.22 的最坏极化把纵向部分精确设为零。首次相遇的归一化增益因此低了两个数量级以上。现在不能宣称一阶解析闭合已经恢复，也不能宣称二阶障碍已经沿真实系数重现。": "The actual coefficients, however, carry a large longitudinal jet, whereas the worst-case polarization in R0.22 sets the longitudinal part exactly to zero. The normalized gain at the first encounter is therefore more than two orders of magnitude smaller. This does not restore first-order analytic closure, nor does it reproduce the second-order obstruction along the true coefficients.",
  "不可压缩条件变为 \\(q(m)\\ell_m+\\beta(m)\\cdot w_m=0\\)。对 \\(m=a+b\\)，令 \\(s=\\beta(b)\\cdot w_a+q(b)\\ell_a\\)。当 \\(q(m)\\ne0\\) 时，": "The incompressibility condition becomes \\(q(m)\\ell_m+\\beta(m)\\cdot w_m=0\\). For \\(m=a+b\\), set \\(s=\\beta(b)\\cdot w_a+q(b)\\ell_a\\). When \\(q(m)\\ne0\\),",
  "但首个增益很弱": "but the first gain is very weak",
  "二次域精确递推、N=2 首次相遇、有限壳层核对与下一步 N=3 判别。": "Exact recurrence in a quadratic number field, the first encounter at N=2, a finite-shell check, and the next N=3 test.",
  "方向出现，不等于复制全空间最坏增益": "The direction appears, but it does not reproduce the worst full-space gain",
  "根中心：R0.20 有理中心": "root center: R0.20 rational center",
  "根中心的右端是正有理数且不是有理平方。因此所有递推系数唯一写成 \\(A+Bt\\)，非零判断使用精确有理数对 \\((A,B)\\)。": "The right-hand side at the root center is a positive rational number but not a rational square. Every recurrence coefficient therefore has a unique form \\(A+Bt\\), and exact rational pairs \\((A,B)\\) are used to test whether it is zero.",
  "继续阅读 R0.24 →": "Continue to R0.24 →",
