  "R0.30 对称化主动递推，并用 \\(Q\\ge-1\\) 的精确支持把全部电荷一次纳入总次数层范数。保守常数 \\(K=96\\) 给出 \\(a,U,V\\) 的共同解析域；在更小圆盘中，\\(U/Z\\)、\\(V/W\\) 不为零，因此本页的对数与指数分解成为解析恒等式。": "R0.30 symmetrizes the active recurrence and uses the exact support \\(Q\\ge-1\\) to include every charge at once in total-degree layer norms. The conservative constant \\(K=96\\) gives a common analytic domain for \\(a,U,V\\); on a smaller polydisc, \\(U/Z\\) and \\(V/W\\) are nonzero, so the logarithmic and exponential factorizations on this page become analytic identities.",
