  "。正式源提交为": ". The formal source commit is",
  "\\(-0.7495\\) 仍未判定": "\\(-0.7495\\) remains undecided",
  "\\(B_U,B_V,H_U,H_V\\) 都不是正测度的直接矩生成函数。": "None of \\(B_U,B_V,H_U,H_V\\) is a direct moment generating function of a positive measure.",
  "\\(B_U\\) 有 13 个负值，\\(B_V\\) 有 20 个负值。普通和移位 Hankel 行列式对 \\(B_U,B_V,H_U,H_V\\) 全部推进到 12 阶，共 96 项。现有 49 个 \\(H_U\\) 系数交替变号，49 个 \\(H_V\\) 系数都为正。": "\\(B_U\\) has 13 negative values and \\(B_V\\) has 20. Ordinary and shifted Hankel determinants for \\(B_U,B_V,H_U,H_V\\) are computed through order 12, giving 96 entries. The 49 available \\(H_U\\) coefficients alternate in sign, while all 49 available \\(H_V\\) coefficients are positive.",
  "\\(H_U\\) 的形式除法从": "Exact formal division for \\(H_U\\) begins with",
  "01 · 反号级数": "01 · Sign-transformed series",
  "02 · 矩条件": "02 · Moment conditions",
