  "不能声称已经跨越 R0.31 边界，不能声称 42 维逆是无穷维逆，不能声称 R0.32 候选得到认证，也不能从本证书推出全局正则性或有限时奇性。": "I cannot claim that the R0.31 boundary has been crossed, that the 42-dimensional inverse is an infinite-dimensional inverse, or that the R0.32 candidate has been certified; nor can this certificate imply global regularity or finite-time singularity.",
  "短步几何": "short-step geometry",
  "短延拓证书": "short continuation certificate",
  "对中心 \\(c=(c_Z,c_W)\\)，定义 \\((\\tau_cf)(\\zeta,\\omega)=f(c_Z+\\zeta,c_W+\\omega)\\)。在加权 Wiener 代数中，每个二项式展开的绝对系数和恰好重组为增大的半径，因此逐分量有": "For the center \\(c=(c_Z,c_W)\\), define \\((\\tau_cf)(\\zeta,\\omega)=f(c_Z+\\zeta,c_W+\\omega)\\). In the weighted Wiener algebra, the sum of absolute coefficients in each binomial expansion recombines exactly at the enlarged radius, so componentwise",
  "二项式定理给出无截断的平移范数界": "The binomial theorem gives a translation-norm bound without truncation",
  "返回研究综述": "return to the research review",
  "非零荷支贡献 \\(3M_1(M_2+M_1^2)\\)，荷零支贡献 \\((2/3)M_1(M_2+M_1^2)\\)。这一定理控制全部形式阶，不依赖四十阶计算。": "The nonzero-charge branch contributes \\(3M_1(M_2+M_1^2)\\), and the charge-zero branch contributes \\((2/3)M_1(M_2+M_1^2)\\). This theorem controls all formal degrees and does not depend on the degree-40 computation.",
