  "几何包含与证书尺度分开呈现": "Geometry inclusion and certificate scales are shown separately",
  "价值仍有明确上限。R0.31 已经保证最终包含球中的精确解存在，所以这一步验证的是重心与认证机制，而不是新的解析域。对三维 Navier–Stokes 千禧年问题的直接贡献仍然很小：对象是约化边缘生成方程，尚未证明它与完整 PDE 的临界动力学具有可逆联系。": "The value still has a clear limit. R0.31 already guarantees the exact solution in the final inclusion ball, so this step validates the recentering and certification mechanism rather than a new analytic domain. Its direct contribution to the three-dimensional Navier-Stokes Millennium Problem remains small: the object is a reduced edge generating equation, and no reversible link to the critical dynamics of the full PDE has been proved.",
  "检查对象": "check",
