  "本证书没有证明 R0.29 的对数商在整个扩大后的多圆盘内仍不为零；共同解析性与对数分解的全域非零性是不同命题。": "This certificate does not prove that the R0.29 logarithmic quotient remains nonzero throughout the enlarged polydisc; common analyticity and global nonvanishing of the logarithmic factorization are different claims.",
  "不能声称 R0.32 候选是真奇点，不能声称已得到完整 Navier–Stokes 解的解析延拓，更不能把约化系统的半径增益表述为千禧年问题的解答。": "I cannot claim that the R0.32 candidate is a true singularity, that an analytic continuation of a full Navier-Stokes solution has been obtained, or that the reduced system's radius gain solves the Millennium Problem.",
  "定理限制在主动支持锥 \\(q\\ge-1\\)，并针对约化边缘生成系统。它没有认证 R0.32 的 Padé 候选，也没有给出三维 Navier–Stokes 方程的全局正则性或有限时奇性结论。": "The theorem is restricted to the active support cone \\(q\\ge-1\\) and concerns the reduced edge-generating system. It does not certify the R0.32 Padé candidate and gives no conclusion about global regularity or finite-time singularity for the three-dimensional Navier-Stokes equations.",
  "对单项式 \\(Z^nW^k\\)，令总次数 \\(L=n+k\\)，荷 \\(q=2k-n\\)。在 \\(q\\ge-1\\) 的支持锥上定义": "For a monomial \\(Z^nW^k\\), let its total degree be \\(L=n+k\\) and its charge be \\(q=2k-n\\). On the support cone \\(q\\ge-1\\), define",
