  "\\(\\phi\\) 无需足够小才能指数化：零常数项的 \\(\\mathcal B_r\\) 元素嵌入普通 Wiener 代数，其指数仍具有有限 Wiener 与次数加权范数。": "\\(\\phi\\) need not be small for exponentiation: a zero-constant element of \\(\\mathcal B_r\\) embeds into the ordinary Wiener algebra, and its exponential still has finite Wiener and degree-weighted norms.",
