  "不可用于一步逆": "Unavailable for a one-step inverse",
  "不能把 \\(0.329\\) 称为真实解析边界，不能把 \\(0.330\\) 的充分界失败解释成奇性，不能把有限列或有限扫描称为全阶证明，也不能声称已证明或反驳三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性。": "I cannot call \\(0.329\\) the true analytic boundary, interpret failure of the sufficient bound at \\(0.330\\) as a singularity, call finite columns or a finite scan an all-order proof, or claim to have proved or disproved three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity.",
  "单项式 Poisson 括号的系数为 \\((is-qj)/3\\)。除以输出次数 \\(i+j\\)，再乘输出权重 \\(i+j\\)，最后除以输入权重 \\(j\\)，得到精确列因子": "The monomial Poisson bracket has coefficient \\((is-qj)/3\\). Dividing by the output degree \\(i+j\\), multiplying by the output weight \\(i+j\\), and finally dividing by the input weight \\(j\\) gives the exact column factor",
  "但当前次数分辨主动尾定理给出": "The present degree-resolved active-tail theorem, however, gives",
  "第一次正式启动在 13.98 秒时被停止，因为人工扩展的短提交号不正确；它没有生成证书，也没有到达数学阈值。其进度与资源日志被原样保留。成功证书 SHA-256 为": "The first formal launch was stopped after 13.98 seconds because the manually expanded short commit was incorrect. It produced no certificate and reached no mathematical threshold. Its progress and resource logs were preserved unchanged. The successful certificate SHA-256 is",
  "对三维 Navier–Stokes 千禧年问题，直接价值仍很小。尚无定理把这个约化典范边系统的解析半径传递到完整 PDE 的任意临界相互作用；当前结果也没有给出尺度临界先验估计、能量级联控制或奇性排除。准确定位应是：派生解析模型中的严格结构进展，而非完整问题的局部解答。": "The direct value for the three-dimensional Navier–Stokes Millennium Problem remains small. No theorem transfers the analytic radius of this reduced canonical edge system to arbitrary critical interactions of the full PDE; nor does the current result provide a scale-critical a priori estimate, control of energy cascade, or exclusion of singularity. Its accurate status is rigorous structural progress in a derived analytic model, not a partial solution of the full problem.",
  "对中心单项式 \\((i,q)\\) 与输入单项式 \\((j,s)\\)，R0.40 的一步算子 \\(T_a=(\\mathcal L-1)^{-1}\\{a,\\cdot\\}\\) 有精确加权列因子": "For a center monomial \\((i,q)\\) and input monomial \\((j,s)\\), the R0.40 one-step operator \\(T_a=(\\mathcal L-1)^{-1}\\{a,\\cdot\\}\\) has the exact weighted column factor",
  "而 \\(\\phi\\) 只需解一个线性方程": "while \\(\\phi\\) only needs to solve one linear equation",
  "方程右端的多项式精确范数为": "The exact polynomial norm of the right-hand side is",
  "公式同时覆盖每个 \\(j\\ge1\\) 和每个允许荷 \\(-j\\le s\\le2j\\)。有限次数列只用于检查代码；定理来自连续斜率区间上的凸性和真实端点。": "The formula simultaneously covers every \\(j\\ge1\\) and every admissible charge \\(-j\\le s\\le2j\\). The finite degree columns only test the implementation; the theorem comes from convexity on the continuous slope interval and the genuine endpoints.",
  "共同半径达到 \\(329/1000\\)": "Common radius reaches \\(329/1000\\)",
  "共同半径相对 R0.41 增长 \\(1316/1125\\approx1.16978\\)；固定荷变量 \\(R=Z^2W\\) 的圆盘半径增长其三次方 \\(2279122496/1423828125\\approx1.60070\\)。": "Relative to R0.41, the common radius grows by \\(1316/1125\\approx1.16978\\); the disc radius for the fixed-charge variable \\(R=Z^2W\\) grows by its cube, \\(2279122496/1423828125\\approx1.60070\\).",
  "共同解析半径提高到 \\(329/1000\\)": "Common analytic radius increases to \\(329/1000\\)",
  "固定 \\(r=0.330\\) 为首个验收点，分解 1.002872 的多项式、尾部与扇区来源；": "Fix \\(r=0.330\\) as the first acceptance point and decompose the polynomial, tail, and sector sources of 1.002872;",
  "规模": "Scale",
  "结构价值高于半径数字；对千禧年问题的直接价值仍然有限": "Structural value exceeds the radius number; direct value for the Millennium Problem remains limited",
  "结论只适用于主动支持锥上的约化典范边生成系统和这里采用的加权 Wiener 范数。它没有证明三维不可压 Navier–Stokes 解全局光滑，也没有构造有限时奇性；\\(0.330\\) 上充分不等式失败不代表那里存在奇点。": "The conclusion applies only to the reduced canonical edge generating system on the active support cone and the weighted Wiener norm used here. It neither proves global smoothness of three-dimensional incompressible Navier–Stokes solutions nor constructs a finite-time singularity; failure of a sufficient inequality at \\(0.330\\) does not imply a singularity there.",
  "解析重构通过": "Analytic reconstruction passes",
  "精确大于一": "Exactly greater than one",
  "精确有限多项式": "Exact finite polynomial",
  "旧输运门槛不是尾估计松弛，而是已知多项式的精确算子范数": "The old transport threshold is not slack in the tail estimate, but the exact operator norm of the known polynomial",
  "旧一步输运范数在 \\(r=0.282\\) 已被已知八十阶多项式精确推过一。我改用 R0.29 的正则分解后，\\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) 的输出次数与加权范数精确消去，一个凸两端点公式覆盖所有输入次数和荷。": "At \\(r=0.282\\), the known degree-80 polynomial already drives the old one-step transport norm exactly above one. I switch to the R0.29 canonical factorization, where the output degree from \\(\\mathcal L^{-1}\\) cancels exactly against the norm weight and one convex two-endpoint formula covers all input degrees and charges.",
  "旧障碍": "Old barrier",
  "旧直接列加主动尾": "Old direct column plus active tail",
  "旧直接输运界": "Old direct transport bound",
  "均精确达到 \\(x=2\\) 端点": "Each exactly attains the \\(x=2\\) endpoint",
  "连续斜率区间 \\([-1,2]\\) 的凸端点归约没有次数网格或荷截断。": "The convex endpoint reduction on the continuous slope interval \\([-1,2]\\) has no degree grid or charge cutoff.",
  "两个输运场可由一个零初值伸缩场重构": "The two transport fields can be reconstructed from one zero-initial stretch field",
