  "八十阶中心的每一项都通过绝对值进入全阶算子界。": "Every term in the degree-80 center enters the all-order operator bound through its absolute value.",
  "八十阶中心满足 \\(1\\le i\\le80\\) 与 \\(-1\\le q\\le2i\\)。在 \\(s\\ge241\\) 上必有 \\(s>q\\)。对 \\(q\\ge0\\)，": "The degree-80 center satisfies \\(1\\le i\\le80\\) and \\(-1\\le q\\le2i\\). On \\(s\\ge241\\), necessarily \\(s>q\\). For \\(q\\ge0\\),",
  "版本 v0.43 · 2026-08-19": "Version v0.43 · 2026-08-19",
  "不能把有限大荷列称为全阶证明，不能把 \\(0.331\\) 的充分界失败解释成奇性，不能把半径增量外推成 PDE 先验估计，也不能声称已证明或反驳三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性。": "Finite large-charge columns cannot be called an all-order proof; failure of the sufficient bound at \\(0.331\\) cannot be interpreted as a singularity; the radius increment cannot be extrapolated into an a priori PDE estimate; and this does not prove or disprove three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity.",
