  "版本 v0.45 · 2026-08-19": "Version v0.45 · 2026-08-19",
  "不能把五个次数回归称为无穷证明，不能把 0.372 的精确列失败解释成奇性，不能把半径增长外推成 PDE 正则时间，也不能声称已经证明或反驳三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性。": "The five degree regressions cannot be presented as an infinite proof; the exact-column failure at 0.372 cannot be interpreted as a singularity; the radius gain cannot be extrapolated to a PDE regularity time; and this result cannot be claimed to prove or disprove three-dimensional Navier–Stokes regularity.",
  "不使用系数符号抵消，要求块谱半径在 0.372 上严格小于一；": "without using coefficient-sign cancellation, require the block spectral radius to be strictly below one at 0.372;",
