  "两个分母在对应区间内都严格为正。图中的曲线采样只负责展示形状，下一节的连续区间符号证书才承担无穷证明。": "Both denominators are strictly positive on their respective intervals. The plotted curve samples only display the shape; the continuous-interval sign certificate in the next section carries the infinite proof.",
