  "精确一阶总次数加权残差范数为": "The exact first-order total-degree-weighted residual norm is",
  "可证伪问题。": "Falsifiable question.",
  "两端 \\(P_c\\) 值分别严格为负和正。独立的 81 项 Sturm 序列次数从 80 降到 0，端点没有零值，变号数由 40 降到 39，因此区间恰含一根。系数正性同时证明这是整个正轴上的唯一根。": "The two endpoint values of \\(P_c\\) are strictly negative and positive. An independent 81-term Sturm sequence decreases in degree from 80 to 0, has no endpoint zeros, and its variation count drops from 40 to 39, so the interval contains exactly one root. Coefficient positivity also proves that this is the only positive root.",
  "令 \\(P_c(r)=A_c(r)-1\\)，则": "Let \\(P_c(r)=A_c(r)-1\\). Then",
  "每个荷的两个全次数凸性端点": "Two all-degree convexity endpoints for each charge",
