  "。科学计算耗时 127.065471 秒；监控历时 127.2 秒、采样 64 次，峰值 CPU 为 100.0%，峰值常驻内存为 201.453 MiB。没有使用 GPU、随机数或浮点符号判定，26 项精确检查全部通过。": ". The scientific computation took 127.065471 seconds. Monitoring covered 127.2 seconds with 64 samples; peak CPU usage was 100.0% and peak resident memory was 201.453 MiB. The run used no GPU, randomness, or floating-point sign decision. All 26 exact checks passed.",
