  "R0.55｜临界 Fourier 桥梁与标量荷障碍": "R0.55 | Critical Fourier bridge and scalar-charge obstruction",
  "R0.56 的验收标准是一个定义完整、坐标无歧义、能处理高--高到低饱和族的方向分辨核定理或不可能性定理，不是再做一轮标量参数优化。": "The R0.56 acceptance criterion is a direction-resolved kernel theorem or impossibility theorem with a complete definition, unambiguous coordinates, and control of the saturating high--high-to-low family, not another round of scalar parameter optimization.",
  "Z. Lei 与 F.-H. Lin，": "Z. Lei and F.-H. Lin,",
  "。提供本页所分解的临界核与精确饱和族。": ". Provides the critical kernel decomposed on this page and the exact saturation family.",
  "\\((n,t_p)\\)、\\((n,t_q)\\)、\\((n,t_k)\\) 分别是 \\(p^\\perp\\)、\\(q^\\perp\\)、\\(k^\\perp\\) 的正交标架。对任意 \\(R\\in SO(3)\\)，整个标架随 \\(R\\) 一起变换，因此公式没有固定坐标轴偏好。": "\\((n,t_p)\\), \\((n,t_q)\\), \\((n,t_k)\\) are respectively orthonormal frames of \\(p^\\perp\\), \\(q^\\perp\\), \\(k^\\perp\\). For any \\(R\\in SO(3)\\), the whole frame transforms together with \\(R\\), so the formula has no fixed coordinate-axis preference.",
  "\\(g_N\\) 与壳比无关，点态饱和在对称化核中仍然存在。": "\\(g_N\\) is independent of the shell ratio, and pointwise saturation still holds in the symmetrized kernel.",
  "\\(g_N\\le1\\)，而且这正是整个有序核的双线性算子范数。等号当且仅当 \\(p\\cdot k=0\\)；取 \\(a=t_p\\)、\\(b=n\\) 即达到等号。非共线时 \\(|c_q|<1\\)，所以 \\(g_T<g_N\\)。": "\\(g_N\\le1\\), and this is precisely the bilinear operator norm of the entire ordered kernel. Equality holds if and only if \\(p\\cdot k=0\\); taking \\(a=t_p\\), \\(b=n\\) attains equality. In the non-collinear case \\(|c_q|<1\\), so \\(g_T<g_N\\).",
