  "4 (1992), 350--363。螺旋模态的三元相互作用分解属于经典先行工作。": "4 (1992), 350--363. The triad interaction decomposition of helical modes is classical pioneering work.",
  "64 (2011), 1297--1304。R0.55 使用的 \\(\\mathcal X^{-1}\\) 小数据框架来自这条已发表基线。": "64 (2011), 1297--1304. The \\(\\mathcal X^{-1}\\) small-data framework used by R0.55 comes from this published baseline.",
  "按 dyadic 输入壳和球面角帽建立离散 \\(TT^*\\) 或平方函数候选，先证明精确缩放与旋转协变性；": "On dyadic input shells and spherical angular caps, build discrete \\(TT^*\\) or square-function candidates, and first prove exact scaling and rotation covariance;",
