  "R0.56：Leray 极化通道与法向障碍": "R0.56: Leray Polarization Channels and the Normal Obstruction",
  "R0.57 相干固定输出频率包、局部化极限与瞬时热演化等号": "R0.57 coherent fixed-output frequency packet, localization limit, and instantaneous heat-evolution equality",
  "R0.57｜相干频率包与固定输出障碍": "R0.57 | Coherent Frequency Packet and the Fixed-Output Obstruction",
  "R0.58 的验收标准是一条带明确输入、输出、时间范数和尖锐尺度的 Duhamel 定理或反例，不是展示几条衰减曲线。": "The acceptance criterion for R0.58 is a Duhamel theorem or counterexample with explicit input, output, time norm, and sharp scaling, not a display of several decay curves.",
  "，证书提交为": ", the certificate commit is",
  "\\(\\mathcal X^{-1}\\) 是 Fourier \\(\\ell^1\\) 范数，符号无法降低输入质量，所以留下 \\(L^{-1}\\) 增益。\\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) 对两个高频输入各收取半阶导数，再增加两个 \\(L^{-1}\\)。这三条不是拟合斜率，而是带显式上下常数的全指标估计。": "\\(\\mathcal X^{-1}\\) is the Fourier \\(\\ell^1\\) norm, so signs cannot reduce the input mass and the \\(L^{-1}\\) gain remains. \\(\\dot H^{1/2}\\) charges each high-frequency input one half derivative, adding two more factors of \\(L^{-1}\\). These are all-index estimates with explicit upper and lower constants, not fitted slopes.",
  "\\[ \\begin{array}{c|c} \\text{归一化}& \\|\\mathcal D_{t_L}(U,V)\\|/(\\|U\\|\\|V\\|)\\\\ \\hline \\text{固定输出 }\\ell^2\\times\\ell^2&\\Theta(L^{-2})\\\\ \\mathcal X^{-1}&\\Theta(L^{-1})\\\\ \\dot H^{1/2}&\\Theta(L^{-3}). \\end{array} \\]": "\\[ \\begin{array}{c|c} \\text{normalization}& \\|\\mathcal D_{t_L}(U,V)\\|/(\\|U\\|\\|V\\|)\\\\ \\hline \\text{fixed output }\\ell^2\\times\\ell^2&\\Theta(L^{-2})\\\\ \\mathcal X^{-1}&\\Theta(L^{-1})\\\\ \\dot H^{1/2}&\\Theta(L^{-3}). \\end{array} \\]",
