  "255 (2008), 2233--2247。给出 \\(\\dot B^{-1}_{\\infty,\\infty}\\) 的高到低范数膨胀机制。": "255 (2008), 2233--2247. Establishes a high-to-low norm-inflation mechanism in \\(\\dot B^{-1}_{\\infty,\\infty}\\).",
  "255 (2008), 2248--2264。系统研究第二迭代的有界性边界。": "255 (2008), 2248--2264. Systematically studies boundedness boundaries for the second iterate.",
