  "最后一个指标不在 \\(\\{-1,0,1\\}\\) 时，相应项为零。这个公式定义两个 \\(48\\times48\\) 整数矩阵 \\(T_0,T_1\\)；两者的精确秩均为 \\(12\\)。": "A term is zero when its last index is outside \\(\\{-1,0,1\\}\\). This formula defines two \\(48\\times48\\) integer matrices \\(T_0,T_1\\); each has exact rank \\(12\\).",
  "R0.64 零时间四十八态传输的超临界循环": "R0.64 supercritical cycle in the zero-time forty-eight-state transfer",
