  "。正式审计耗时约 \\(511\\) 秒，峰值常驻内存约 \\(836\\) MiB；四个直接路径枚举与精确矩中心的相对差均低于 \\(10^{-12}\\)。": ". The formal audit took approximately \\(511\\) seconds with peak resident memory of about \\(836\\) MiB; the relative discrepancies between four direct path enumerations and the exact-moment centers were all below \\(10^{-12}\\).",
