  "M=16 的完整八阶七单形热和严格为正；渐近主热 jet 数值稳定在负值。缺陷预解式和九阶导数界仍待严格闭合。": "The complete eighth-order seven-simplex heat sum at M=16 is rigorously positive; the asymptotic dominant heat jet is numerically stable at a negative value. The defect resolvent and ninth-derivative bounds still require rigorous closure.",
  "R0.68B-2 八阶首周期精确热区间与八次主热 jet 收敛期刊附图": "R0.68B-2 journal figure for the exact eighth-order first-cycle heat interval and convergence of the degree-eight dominant heat jet",
