  "120 项时间区间把最大十一阶导数严格压到 \\(2.567\\times10^{-6}\\) 以下": "A 120-term time interval strictly bounds the largest eleventh derivative below \\(2.567\\times10^{-6}\\)",
  "4,368 个多重指标逐项进入有理区间比较。": "All 4,368 multi-indices enter the rational interval comparison term by term.",
  "版本 v0.68B-2e · 2026-08-21": "Version v0.68B-2e · 2026-08-21",
