  "对纯粹的数据包上界 \\((6+4\\sqrt{2})\\rho^r\\)，证书逐项向上舍入，并给出以下首次严格穿越：": "For the packet-only upper bound \\((6+4\\sqrt{2})\\rho^r\\), the certificate rounds every term upward and gives the following first strict crossings:",
