  "保留远场引理，淘汰当前近场范数作为新判据": "Retain the far-field lemma; reject the current near norm as a new criterion",
  "比较必须从适当弱解层级开始，而不是从光滑解假设开始": "The comparison must begin at the suitable-weak-solution level, not with smoothness assumed",
  "标准局部能量不等式中的 \\(pu\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\) 在适当弱解空间中有意义；把它改写为 \\(b_r\\) 的绝对值形式会丢失抵消并要求额外可积性。": "The term \\(pu\\cdot\\nabla\\phi\\) in the standard local energy inequality is meaningful in suitable-weak-solution spaces; rewriting it in the absolute-value form \\(b_r\\) loses cancellation and requires extra integrability.",
