  "R0.69L 作为光滑场估计成立，但其当前形式不是新的 \\(\\varepsilon\\)-正则性判据。真正缺口是近场配对指数，不再是远近分离半径。": "R0.69L is valid as a smooth-field estimate, but its current form is not a new \\(\\varepsilon\\)-regularity criterion. The real gap is the near-field pairing exponent, not the near/far separation radius.",
