  "把应变取反即可在相同模长下达到负端点。因此任何只使用光滑性与不可压性的普适点态符号、严格亏损系数或自动方向相干性都不成立。": "Reversing the strain attains the negative endpoint with the same magnitudes. Therefore no universal pointwise sign, strict deficit coefficient, or automatic direction coherence follows from smoothness and incompressibility alone.",
  "版本 v0.69P · 2026-08-21": "Version v0.69P · 2026-08-21",
  "本结果关闭一条错误捷径，同时把开放问题压缩成可检验对象": "This result closes a false shortcut and compresses the open problem into testable objects",
  "不可压性本身不产生有利符号，也不改进尖锐系数": "Incompressibility alone gives neither a favorable sign nor an improved sharp coefficient",
  "不可压性不强迫有利对齐；Betchov 恒等式隔离正的中间应变特征值，但能量层级仍产生六次余项。": "Incompressibility does not force favorable alignment; the Betchov identity isolates the positive middle strain eigenvalue, but energy-level control still yields a sextic remainder.",
