  "常数 \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) 不能降低。更强的是：对任意 \\(s,w>0\\)，存在光滑、紧支撑、散度为零的速度场，在一个开球上同时满足": "The constant \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) cannot be reduced. More strongly, for every \\(s,w>0\\), there is a smooth, compactly supported, divergence-free velocity field satisfying the following identities on an open ball:",
  "当 \\(r\\to\\infty\\) 时该比值趋于二，因此": "As \\(r\\to\\infty\\), this ratio tends to two; therefore",
  "的尺度局部时空亏损。方向相干性判据说明额外几何信息在条件下可以充分，但不能把这些条件当作能量不等式已经推出的结论。": "as a scale-local spacetime deficit. Direction-coherence criteria show that additional geometric information can be sufficient when assumed, but those assumptions cannot be treated as consequences of the energy inequality.",
