  "对周期或充分衰减的光滑无散场，分部积分给出 \\(\\int\\operatorname{tr}(A^3)=0\\)。又因无迹三阶矩阵满足 \\(\\operatorname{tr}(S^3)=3\\det S\\)，所以": "For a smooth periodic or sufficiently decaying solenoidal field, integration by parts gives \\(\\int\\operatorname{tr}(A^3)=0\\). Since a trace-free three-dimensional matrix also satisfies \\(\\operatorname{tr}(S^3)=3\\det S\\),",
  "分母为零时取零。两者都在 \\([0,1]\\) 中，而局部实现证明能量与不可压性允许端点一。故真正缺少的是对": "Set either expression to zero when its denominator vanishes. Both lie in \\([0,1]\\), while the local realization shows that energy and incompressibility permit the endpoint one. The genuinely missing information is therefore a bound on",
  "符号重写没有改变能量估计的六次余项": "The sign reformulation does not change the sextic energy remainder",
  "附图同时展示尖锐对齐、Betchov 比值与六次 Young 端点": "The figure displays sharp alignment, the Betchov ratio, and the sextic Young endpoint together",
  "积极价值有两层。第一，最坏点态常数不仅是抽象矩阵上界，而且能在紧支撑无散场的小球内精确实现；所以后续证明不应再期待局部不可压性自动提供严格小于一的对齐系数。第二，Betchov 恒等式把真正的全局正产生定位到 \\(\\lambda_2^+\\)，使下一步可以针对一个明确的有符号量设计时空估计。": "The positive value has two parts. First, the worst pointwise constant is not merely an abstract matrix bound: it is realized exactly on a ball inside a compactly supported solenoidal field. A later proof should therefore not expect local incompressibility to supply an alignment coefficient strictly below one. Second, the Betchov identity locates the true global positive production in \\(\\lambda_2^+\\), giving the next stage a precise signed target for a spacetime estimate.",
  "尖锐常数": "Sharp constant",
  "接受标准不变：不能预设 Lipschitz 方向相干、Serrin 混合范数或待证明的 \\(L_t^1L_x^\\infty\\) 控制。若推导只重新表述已有条件正则性判据，就把它记录为条件接口；若出现不受控制的 \\(|\\omega|^{-1}\\) 奇性或同阶交换子，就构造反例并关闭该分支。": "The acceptance criterion is unchanged: no Lipschitz direction coherence, Serrin mixed norm, or still-unproved \\(L_t^1L_x^\\infty\\) bound may be assumed. If the derivation only restates a known conditional regularity criterion, I will record it as a conditional interface. If an uncontrolled \\(|\\omega|^{-1}\\) singularity or an equal-order commutator appears, I will construct a counterexample and close that branch.",
  "经典结构、项目新增审计与未解决部分分开陈述": "Classical structure, project audit, and unresolved work are stated separately",
  "精确达到，因为 \\(|S_+|=s\\) 且 \\(\\omega_+\\cdot S_+\\omega_+=\\sqrt{2/3}\\,sw^2\\)。这不是数值近似，而是代数等号。": "This is attained exactly because \\(|S_+|=s\\) and \\(\\omega_+\\cdot S_+\\omega_+=\\sqrt{2/3}\\,sw^2\\). It is an algebraic equality, not a numerical approximation.",
  "局部实现": "Local realization",
