  "其代数端点是精确的：": "Its algebraic endpoint is exact:",
  "取 \\(\\chi\\in C_c^\\infty(B_2)\\)、\\(\\chi=1\\) 于 \\(B_1\\)，定义": "Choose \\(\\chi\\in C_c^\\infty(B_2)\\) with \\(\\chi=1\\) on \\(B_1\\), and define",
  "全局抵消把方向对齐改写为应变行列式": "Global cancellation converts direction alignment into the strain determinant",
