  "研究笔记 R0.69P · 涡量拉伸的尖锐符号结构": "Research note R0.69P · sharp sign structure of vortex stretching",
  "研究笔记 R0.69P：求出涡量拉伸与中间应变特征值的尖锐常数，构造局部饱和的紧支撑无散场，并证明仅靠能量信息仍留下六次余项。": "Research note R0.69P: derive the sharp constants for vortex stretching and the middle strain eigenvalue, construct a compactly supported solenoidal field that locally saturates them, and prove that energy information alone still leaves a sextic remainder.",
  "也为尖锐等式，其见证是 \\(S=|S|\\operatorname{diag}(-2,1,1)/\\sqrt6\\)，并可由上一节的紧支撑构造在小球内实现。正的中间特征值因此不是不可压性自动压低的量。": "is also sharp, witnessed by \\(S=|S|\\operatorname{diag}(-2,1,1)/\\sqrt6\\), and the compactly supported construction from the preceding section realizes it on a ball. Positive middle strain is therefore not automatically reduced by incompressibility.",
  "因此 R0.69O 与本版本把预算分开了：压力余项是 \\(\\mathsf A_v^2\\mathsf E_v\\) 的二次时间量，拉伸余项仍是 \\(\\int\\sigma^6dt\\)。": "R0.69O and this release therefore separate the budget: the pressure remainder is the quadratic time quantity \\(\\mathsf A_v^2\\mathsf E_v\\), while the stretching remainder remains \\(\\int\\sigma^6dt\\).",
  "由中间特征值界只能得到": "The middle-eigenvalue bound gives only",
  "源笔记、形式证书和期刊图分别锁定到完整提交": "The source note, formal certificate, and journal figure are locked to separate full commits",
  "则 \\(v_A\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^3)\\)、\\(\\nabla\\cdot v_A=0\\)，并在整个 \\(B_1\\) 内等于 \\(Ax\\)。所以尖锐矩阵对不是不可实现的局部喷射；它确实存在于光滑有限能量无散场的一个开集上。外部截断环带承担全局积分恒等式要求的补偿。": "Then \\(v_A\\in C_c^\\infty(\\mathbb R^3)\\), \\(\\nabla\\cdot v_A=0\\), and throughout \\(B_1\\) the field equals \\(Ax\\). Thus the sharp matrix pair is not an unrealizable local jet; it occurs on an open set in a smooth finite-energy solenoidal field. The outer cutoff annulus supplies the compensation required by global integral identities.",
  "这里关闭的是“不可压性自动改善点态拉伸几何”这条路线。它不排除 Navier–Stokes 动力学在时空平均、非局部耦合或条件几何假设下产生耗散，也没有解决千禧年问题。": "This closes the route claiming that incompressibility automatically improves pointwise stretching geometry. It does not exclude depletion generated by Navier–Stokes dynamics through spacetime averaging, nonlocal coupling, or conditional geometric assumptions, and it does not solve the Millennium Problem.",
  "这是高质量的无增益定理和路线筛选结果，而不是正则性突破。它减少了模糊搜索空间，并把下一阶段的成功标准明确为无条件、尺度临界的时空亏损。": "This is a rigorous no-gain theorem and a route-screening result, not a regularity theorem. It reduces an ambiguous search space and defines the next success criterion as an unconditional, scale-critical spacetime deficit.",
  "正产生只来自正的中间应变特征值": "Positive production comes only from a positive middle strain eigenvalue",
  "证书运行：0.42 秒": "Certificate run: 0.42 seconds",
  "中的常数二是尖锐上确界。另一方面，": "has sharp supremum two. On the other hand,",
  "中间特征值": "Middle eigenvalue",
  "主要来源：": "Primary sources:",
  "状态 · R0.69P 完成": "Status · R0.69P complete",
  "最坏情形是涡量沿最大伸长特征方向排列": "The worst case aligns vorticity with the most extensional eigenvector",
  "Betchov 的全局三次恒等式、Constantin–Fefferman 的涡量方向条件正则性路线，以及基于中间应变特征值的正则性判据都属于已有工作。本版本的项目内贡献是：在 R0.69O 后的确切预算位置统一比较这些机制，给出尖锐常数的符号审计，并用显式向量势把所有无迹仿射喷射嵌入紧支撑无散场。这里不主张该局部构造具有文献首创性。": "Betchov's global cubic identity, the Constantin–Fefferman conditional regularity route based on vorticity direction, and regularity criteria based on the middle strain eigenvalue are prior work. The project contribution in this release is to compare those mechanisms at the exact budget reached after R0.69O, audit the sharp constants and signs, and embed every trace-free affine jet in a compactly supported solenoidal field through an explicit vector potential. I make no claim of literature priority for that local construction.",
  "Betchov 恒等式是真抵消，但不是符号定理：它只把产生量从涡量对齐换成了有符号的应变行列式。": "The Betchov identity is a genuine cancellation, but not a sign theorem: it replaces vorticity alignment by the signed strain determinant.",
  "Betchov（1956，涡量产生恒等式）": "Betchov (1956, vorticity-production identity)",
  "Constantin–Fefferman（1993，涡量方向与正则性）": "Constantin–Fefferman (1993, vorticity direction and regularity)",
  "Miller（中间应变特征值判据）": "Miller (middle strain eigenvalue criterion)",
  "R0.69O 已把领先压力余项降回二次涡量。我现在把剩余的三维拉伸拆到应变特征架中：点态常数 \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) 是尖锐的，而且任意取等速度梯度都能嵌入紧支撑无散场，在整个小球上实现。Betchov 恒等式把全局产生量改写为正的中间应变特征值，却没有降低能量估计的六次时间代价。": "R0.69O returned the leading pressure remainder to quadratic enstrophy. I now decompose the remaining three-dimensional stretching in the strain eigenframe: the pointwise constant \\(\\sqrt{2/3}\\) is sharp, and every equality-case velocity gradient can be embedded in a compactly supported solenoidal field and realized on a whole ball. The Betchov identity rewrites global production using the positive middle strain eigenvalue, but it does not lower the sextic time cost of the energy estimate.",
  "R0.69P 涡量拉伸尖锐对齐、中间应变特征值与六次能量余项": "R0.69P sharp vortex alignment, middle strain eigenvalue, and sextic energy remainder",
  "R0.69P｜点态拉伸可精确饱和，真正缺少的是时空耗散结构": "R0.69P | Pointwise stretching can saturate exactly; the missing structure is spacetime depletion",
  "R0.69Q 将审计涡量方向运输能否产生无条件时空亏损": "R0.69Q will audit whether vorticity-direction transport yields an unconditional spacetime deficit",
