  "版本 v0.69Q · 2026-08-21": "Version v0.69Q · 2026-08-21",
  "本版本把一个容易重复计数的直觉变成了可检验的否定定理。方向扩散确实存在，但它没有增加 enstrophy 预算；最大正拉伸与零方向耗散还能在一个开球上同时出现，并能作为真正解的光滑初值。": "This release turns an easily double-counted intuition into a testable negative theorem. Direction diffusion is real, but it adds nothing to the enstrophy budget; maximal positive stretching and zero directional dissipation can occur together on a ball and can serve as smooth initial data for a genuine solution.",
  "查看 R0.69Q 形式证书": "View the R0.69Q formal certificate",
