  "代入 \\(X=C_{\\rm n}A^{1/2}B^{5/2}\\)、\\(Y=C_{\\rm f}A^3\\)，可见 \\(r_*\\) 正比于 \\(A/B\\)，而 \\(X^{3/5}Y^{2/5}\\) 精确等于常数乘 \\(A^{3/2}B^{3/2}\\)。所以结果不是任意选取分裂半径造成的松弛。": "Substituting \\(X=C_{\\rm n}A^{1/2}B^{5/2}\\) and \\(Y=C_{\\rm f}A^3\\) shows that \\(r_*\\) is proportional to \\(A/B\\), while \\(X^{3/5}Y^{2/5}\\) is exactly a constant times \\(A^{3/2}B^{3/2}\\). The result is therefore not slack caused by an arbitrary splitting radius.",
