  "R0.32 已完成：": "R0.32 is complete:",
  "R0.33 排除一条自然的 Padé 证明路线，不是否定约 \\(-0.7495\\) 的候选。 变换后的 Stieltjes 形式、解析背景扣除、符号或复测度及其他收敛理论仍未检查，也没有三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性或奇性结论。": "R0.33 excludes one natural Pade proof route; it does not refute the candidate near \\(-0.7495\\). Transformed Stieltjes forms, analytic-background subtraction, signed or complex measures, and other convergence theorems remain untested, and there is no conclusion about three-dimensional Navier-Stokes regularity or singularity.",
  "R0.33 已完成：": "R0.33 is complete:",
  "R0.34 关闭有限 Taylor 头部修复路线，但不排除能改变全部尾系数的无限解析背景， 不判定约 \\(-0.7495\\) 的候选，也没有三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性或奇性结论。": "R0.34 closes the finite Taylor-head repair route but does not exclude an infinite analytic background that can change every tail coefficient, does not decide the candidate near \\(-0.7495\\), and gives no conclusion about three-dimensional Navier-Stokes regularity or singularity.",
  "R0.34 已完成：": "R0.34 is complete:",
  "R0.35 否定的是两种朴素验证架构，不是证明候选奇点存在。 当前结果属于约化边缘生成方程，没有三维 Navier–Stokes 正则性或奇性结论。": "R0.35 rules out two naive validation architectures; it does not prove the candidate singularity exists. The current result concerns a reduced edge generating equation and gives no conclusion about three-dimensional Navier-Stokes regularity or singularity.",
  "R0.35 已完成：": "R0.35 is complete:",
  "R0.36 已完成：": "R0.36 is complete:",
