  "R0.41 已完成：": "R0.41 complete:",
  "R0.41 在 \\(r=0.282\\) 的旧一步输运界为 \\(1.0003750452>1\\)。 其中八十阶已知多项式已经贡献 \\(1.0003748969\\)，未知主动尾只有约 \\(1.48\\times10^{-7}\\)；因此旧障碍是精确算子范数，而不是尾估计松弛。": "At \\(r=0.282\\), the old one-step transport bound from R0.41 is \\(1.0003750452>1\\). The known degree-80 polynomial already contributes \\(1.0003748969\\), while the unknown active tail contributes only about \\(1.48\\times10^{-7}\\); the old barrier is therefore an exact operator norm, not slack in the tail estimate.",
  "R0.42 已完成：": "R0.42 is complete:",
  "R0.42 在 \\(r=0.330\\) 留下的主动尾界为 \\(1.0028721509>1\\)， 最大部分来自全部输入荷 \\(s\\ge241\\)。旧解析扇区已经使用荷条件控制荷比， 却在递减次数前因子中只保留通用严格尾条件 \\(j>80\\)。": "At \\(r=0.330\\), R0.42 left an active-tail bound of \\(1.0028721509>1\\), with the largest contribution coming from all input charges \\(s\\ge241\\). The old analytic sector already used the charge condition to control the charge ratio, but retained only the generic strict-tail condition \\(j>80\\) in the decreasing degree prefactor.",
  "R0.43 已完成：": "R0.43 is complete:",
  "R0.43 在 \\(r=0.331\\) 留下的大正荷界为 \\(1.0038955266>1\\)。 该界让每个中心项独立选择 \\(x=s/j\\in[0,2]\\) 的最坏端点， 但一个真实尾输入列只能共享同一个 \\(x\\)。": "At \\(r=0.331\\), R0.43 left a large-positive-charge bound of \\(1.0038955266>1\\). That bound let each center term independently choose the worst endpoint of \\(x=s/j\\in[0,2]\\), but a genuine tail-input column must share a single \\(x\\).",
  "R0.44 已完成：": "R0.44 is complete:",
  "R0.44 在 \\(r=0.371\\) 留下的 \\(s=-1\\) 统一界为 \\(1.0008564924>1\\)，但真实最低次数 \\(j=82\\) 列只有 \\(0.9972280412\\)。有限格点不能证明其余全部次数都更小。": "At \\(r=0.371\\), R0.44 left the uniform \\(s=-1\\) bound at \\(1.0008564924>1\\), while the exact minimum-degree \\(j=82\\) column is only \\(0.9972280412\\). Finite lattice points cannot prove that every remaining degree is smaller.",
  "R0.45 已完成：": "R0.45 is complete:",
  "R0.45 在 \\(r=0.372\\) 的无权 \\(s=-1\\) 真实列上给出 \\(1.0010616516>1\\)。我把输出荷零和输出荷非零分成两块，并采用 \\[ \\|f\\|_{r,\\kappa} =\\kappa\\|P_0f\\|_{B_r}+\\|P_{\\ne0}f\\|_{B_r}, \\qquad \\kappa=\\frac34. \\]": "At \\(r=0.372\\), R0.45 gives the exact unweighted \\(s=-1\\) column as \\(1.0010616516>1\\). I split output charge zero from output charge nonzero into two blocks and use \\[ \\|f\\|_{r,\\kappa} =\\kappa\\|P_0f\\|_{B_r}+\\|P_{\\ne0}f\\|_{B_r}, \\qquad \\kappa=\\frac34. \\]",
  "R0.46 已完成：": "R0.46 is complete:",
  "R0.46 在 \\(r=0.377\\) 留下的大正荷充分界为 \\(1.0030411177>1\\)，但它分别最大化次数因子、荷比和共同斜率。 一个真实输入单项式不能独立选择这些最坏值。": "At \\(r=0.377\\), R0.46 left a large-positive-charge sufficient bound of \\(1.0030411177>1\\), but it separately maximized the degree factor, charge ratio, and common slope. A true input monomial cannot independently choose those worst cases.",
  "R0.47 已完成：": "R0.47 is complete:",
  "R0.47 只给出相邻百万分位的通过点和失败点。R0.48 把真实 \\(s=162,j=81\\) 活跃列写成显式 80 次多项式 \\[ A(r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{80}\\alpha_i r^i,\\qquad \\alpha_i>0. \\] 因此 \\(P(r)=A(r)-1\\) 在正轴严格递增，正根全局唯一。": "R0.47 gave only the passing and failing endpoints of adjacent millionths. R0.48 writes the true active \\(s=162,j=81\\) column as an explicit degree-80 polynomial \\[ A(r)=\\sum_{i=1}^{80}\\alpha_i r^i,\\qquad \\alpha_i>0. \\] Therefore \\(P(r)=A(r)-1\\) is strictly increasing on the positive axis, and its positive root is globally unique.",
  "R0.48 已完成：": "R0.48 has been completed:",
  "R0.49 已完成：": "R0.49 completed:",
  "R0.5 已完成：": "R0.5 has been completed:",
