  "R0.67C-2 已完成：": "R0.67C-2 is complete:",
  "R0.68A 的无限尾定理之后，八阶零时间 1792 态谱与可达主投影也已精确闭合；下一步是完整七单形热投影。": "After the infinite-tail theorem of R0.68A, the eighth-order zero-time 1792-state spectrum and the reachable dominant projection are also exactly closed; next is the complete seven-simplex heat projection.",
  "R0.68B-1 已完成：": "R0.68B-1 complete:",
  "R0.68B-2h 的严格八次热系数补上了 R0.68A 全阶尾定理留下的 最后一个有限阶缺口。在四次临界振幅 \\[ \\varepsilon_r^2=(16/\\lambda)^r \\] 下，二次归一化目标的完整极限为 \\[ R_\\infty=1-\\frac{C_*}{3600D_*}>1. \\] 256 位定向舍入把正修正封闭在 \\[ 2.5937453534608412212\\times10^{-8} <R_\\infty-1< 2.6140836268319572193\\times10^{-8}. \\]": "The strict eighth-order heat coefficient from R0.68B-2h fills the last finite-order gap left by the R0.68A all-order tail theorem. At the quartic-critical amplitude \\[ \\varepsilon_r^2=(16/\\lambda)^r \\], the complete limit of the quadratically normalized target is \\[ R_\\infty=1-\\frac{C_*}{3600D_*}>1. \\] Directed rounding at 256-bit precision encloses the positive correction in \\[ 2.5937453534608412212\\times10^{-8} <R_\\infty-1< 2.6140836268319572193\\times10^{-8}. \\]",
  "R0.69N 的尖峰仍令三次代价按 \\(A\\) 增长，但插值强迫其二阶耗散质量至少按 \\(A^2\\) 增长，所以它不能否定耗散辅助吸收。Bogovskii 高阶估计把 \\(\\mathcal D_v\\) 还原为扩大球二阶耗散与显式截断代价。": "The R0.69N spike still makes the cubic cost grow like \\(A\\), but the interpolation forces its second-derivative dissipation mass to grow at least like \\(A^2\\), so it cannot disprove dissipation-assisted absorption. The higher-order Bogovskii estimate reduces \\(\\mathcal D_v\\) to enlarged-ball second-derivative dissipation and explicit cutoff costs.",
  "R0.69U 的结果：": "R0.69U result:",
